  "full_text": "I can show you how I make myself. The best part is that Chris is really excited to be digging into this right now. Traditional tea houses where men would come together to recite old folk tales and listen to music while appreciating how one should drink tea. And of course, we will take you to Naya. It's been perfecting its kebab for over 130 years. It's great. I'm going to be a kebab guru by the end of this. I'm going to show off to all my friends. Because if you can make a good kebab in Iran, then you're set. and caviar the jewel of the caspian sea known in this country as the black gold dubai tabu dhabi to london toronto and of course tehran i mean all my memories about food in tehran they're quite a number considering i was nicknamed shekamu which means someone who purely thinks from their stomach quite hungry tehran is in the north central area of iran surrounded by the alborz mountains the capital holds about 8 million people 13 million if you include the out of tehran okay i'm gonna take a walk to the store i will bring the camera how about that",
